FROM golang:1.26.6-alpine@sha256:af8d6740070b8906d12eae1c3e3ea0957fb63f492051ea05e354c38ef9fe88df AS build
ENV CGO_ENABLED=0 \
    GOTOOLCHAIN=local \
    GOPROXY=https://proxy.golang.org \
    GOSUMDB=sum.golang.org
WORKDIR /src
RUN go install go.opentelemetry.io/collector/cmd/builder@v0.158.0
COPY collector-builder.yaml /src/collector-builder.yaml
RUN builder --skip-compilation --config /src/collector-builder.yaml
RUN cd /src/build && go build -trimpath -ldflags='-s -w -buildid=' -o /out/dashboard-otelcol .

FROM scratch AS evidence
COPY --from=build /src/build/go.mod /go.mod
COPY --from=build /src/build/go.sum /go.sum
COPY --from=build /out/dashboard-otelcol /dashboard-otelcol

FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian13@sha256:f7f8f729987ad0fdf6b05eeeae94b26e6a0f613bdf46feea7fc40f7bd72953e6 AS runtime
COPY --from=build /out/dashboard-otelcol /dashboard-otelcol
USER 65532:65532
ENTRYPOINT ["/dashboard-otelcol"]
